</ul>

<h2>3. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
<p>Our website uses cookies to improve performance and user experience. You may disable cookies in your browser settings, although some functionality may be affected.</p>

<h2>4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
<p>We may share your data with:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Payment processors</li>
    <li>Shipping carriers</li>
