</ul>
<p>We do not sell or trade personal information.</p>

<h2>5. Data Security</h2>
<p>We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information from unauthorized access or disclosure.</p>

<h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
<p>You may request to update or delete your stored personal information by contacting us.</p>

<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
